usage: cami task [-h] [--workspace WORKSPACE] --task-file TASK_FILE
                 --context-file CONTEXT_FILE --grade-json GRADE_JSON
                 [--journal-root JOURNAL_ROOT] [--model MODEL]
                 [--opencode-binary OPENCODE_BINARY]
                 [--origin {user,admission,experiment}]

Run captured tasks through a local Linux OpenCode service, or recover their
journals.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --workspace WORKSPACE
  --task-file TASK_FILE
  --context-file CONTEXT_FILE
                        Declared meaningful external inputs and toolchain
                        identity
  --grade-json GRADE_JSON
                        Fixed test argv as JSON; no shell
  --journal-root JOURNAL_ROOT
  --model MODEL
  --opencode-binary OPENCODE_BINARY
  --origin {user,admission,experiment}
